    {
      "id": "s01-flow",
      "intent": "The recurrence returns to the DQ-CTM thought stage itself, while the dense carrier continues through the rest of the image pipeline.",
      "claim": "A persistent dense carrier, read and updated by a compact thought process.",
      "narration": "The image first becomes a dense carrier before it is split into windows. The compact DQ-CTM process runs repeated ticks on those window tokens. The recurrence returns only to the thought stage, with parameters shared across ticks.",
